(
    title: "Road Runner",
    developer: Some("Bob Polaro"),
    description: Some("Wile E. Coyote is on your tail down a desert highway, and outrunning him means eating every pile of birdseed you pass. Trucks, land mines, cannonballs and falling rocks crowd the road, and cliffs have to be jumped. Steel shot scores too, but swallowing it leaves you vulnerable to the coyote\'s magnet across eight escalating levels."),
